       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             TPMXFERD.
       AUTHOR.                 W. ROXBURY.
       INSTALLATION.           GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.
      *
      *REMARKS.                UTILITY TO WRITE THE SHORT DESCRIPTION
      *                        FROM A PM WORKORDER TO THE SPECIAL
      *                        INSTRUCTION LINE FOR DISPLAY PURPOSES.
      *                        RUN THIS PROGRAM ONE TIME TO COPY THE
      *                        DESCRIPTION FIELD ON ALL EXISTING PM
      *                        WORKORDERS.  ALL NEWLY CREATED PM'S
      *                        WILL ALREADY USE THE NEW METHOD.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT WO-PLANNED
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                               WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  WO-PLANNED
           LABEL RECORDS       ARE STANDARD.
       01  PWO-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1101.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  SAVE-WO             PIC X(07).
       77  SAVE-DESC           PIC X(30).
       77  TRUE-VAL            PIC 1            VALUE B"1".

       01  FILE-STAT.
           05 FILE-STAT-1      PIC X            VALUE "0".
           05 FILE-STAT-2      PIC X            VALUE "0".

       01  DB-ERROR.
           05  DB-FUNC   PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
           05  DB-FILE   PIC X(18) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER    PIC X(20) VALUE "ERROR - FILE-STAT = ".
           05  CON-WORD  PIC XX.

       01  WO-PLANNED-DATA.
           COPY DWOPLAN        IN COPYLIB.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       OPEN-FILES.
           OPEN I-O            WO-PLANNED.
           MOVE SPACES         TO WO-PLANNED-DATA SAVE-WO SAVE-DESC.
           READ WO-PLANNED     FIRST INTO WO-PLANNED-DATA
               AT END          MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STAT = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   GO TO END-OF-JOB
               ELSE
                   MOVE FILE-STAT  TO CON-WORD
                   MOVE "READ FST" TO DB-FUNC
                   MOVE "WO-PLANNED" TO DB-FILE
                   DISPLAY DB-ERROR
                   GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           GO TO LOOP-CONT.

       READ-LOOP.
           MOVE SPACES         TO WO-PLANNED-DATA.
           READ WO-PLANNED     NEXT INTO WO-PLANNED-DATA
               AT END          MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STAT = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   GO TO END-OF-JOB
               ELSE
                   MOVE FILE-STAT  TO CON-WORD
                   MOVE "READ NXT" TO DB-FUNC
                   MOVE "WO-PLANNED" TO DB-FILE
                   DISPLAY DB-ERROR
                   GO TO END-OF-JOB.

       LOOP-CONT.
           IF WO-START-STATUS = "AA" OR "AR"
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               GO TO READ-LOOP.

           IF WO-NUM-SUFF-P = "000"
               MOVE WO-NUM-P   TO SAVE-WO
               MOVE DESCRIPTION-1-P TO SAVE-DESC
               GO TO READ-LOOP.

           IF WO-NUM-P NOT = SAVE-WO
               GO TO READ-LOOP.

           MOVE SAVE-DESC      TO SPECL-INSTR-2.

           REWRITE PWO-REC     FROM WO-PLANNED-DATA
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               MOVE "REWRITE " TO DB-FUNC
               MOVE "WO-PLANNED" TO DB-FILE
               MOVE FILE-STAT  TO CON-WORD
               DISPLAY DB-ERROR
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           GO TO READ-LOOP.

       END-OF-JOB.
           CLOSE               WO-PLANNED.
           GOBACK.

